  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We apply each option to the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) 8 and 32\n\n16 × __**12 ÷ 4**__ + 32 - 16 = 8\n\n**__16 × __**__3__** + 32 - 16 = 8**\n__**48 + 32**__ - 16 = 8\n\n__**80 - 16**__ = 8\n\n64 ≠ 8 \n\nOption 2) 4 and 32\n16 × __**12 ÷ 32**__ + 8 - 16 = 4\n\n__**16 × **____0.3__** + 8 - 16 = 4**\n__**4.8 + 8**__ - 16 = 4\n\n__**12.8 - 16**__ = 4\n\n-3.2 ≠ 4\n\nOption 3) 8 and 16\n8 × __**12 ÷ 4**__ + 16 - 8 = 32\n\n__**8 × **____3__** + 16 - 8 = 32\n\n__**24 + 16**__ - 8 = 32\n\n__**40 - 8**__ = 32\n\n32 = 32\n\nOption 4) 12 and 16\n12 × __**16 ÷ 4**__ + 8 - 12 = 32\n\n__**12 × **4__ + 8 - 12 = 32\n\n__**48 **____**+ 8 **__- 12 = 32\n\n__**56 - 12**__ = 32\n\n44 ≠ 32\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 3)**",
